{"ref":"BDB, אֶתְנַן²","hw":"אֶתְנַן²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֶתְנַן</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:34\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.34\">Ez 16:34</a> hire of harlot <strong>(</strong> = <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶתְנָה</span><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:34\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.34\">Ez 16:34</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:41\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.41\">41</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶתְנָ֑ן</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:1\" href=\"/Hosea.9.1\">Ho 9:1</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶתֽנַן</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.19\">Dt 23:19</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶתְנַנָּהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 23:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.23.18\">Is 23:18</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נָּהֿ</span>— v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 23:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.23.17\">17</a>; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶתְנַנֶּיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:7\" href=\"/Micah.1.7\">Mi 1:7a</a> (We proposes <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲשֵׁרֶיהָ</span>, cf. Now Marti);—harlot’s <em>hire</em>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 23:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.23.19\">Dt 23:19</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(א׳ זוֹנָה)</span>, elsewhere in fig.: of idolatrous Israel <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:1\" href=\"/Hosea.9.1\">Ho 9:1</a>, Jerus. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:31\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.31\">Ez 16:31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:34\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.34\">34</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:41\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.41\">41</a>, Tyre <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 23:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.23.17\">Is 23:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 23:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.23.18\">18</a>; of costly idols of Samaria <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:7\" href=\"/Micah.1.7\">Mi 1:7b</a>, <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:7\" href=\"/Micah.1.7\">7c</a>, cf. v <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:7\" href=\"/Micah.1.7\">7a</a> (v. supra).","next":"BDB, תִּנְשֶׁ֫מֶת²","prev":"BDB, תנן²"}